$1^{\circ}$ All segments $C_{1} C_{2}, C_{2} C_{3}, \ldots C_{95} C_{96}, C_{96} C_{1}$ have the length $\sqrt{13}$;
$2^{\circ}$ The poligonal line $C_{1} C_{2} \ldots C_{96} C_{1}$ is centrally symmetric?

